<title>USA: Checkpoint Systems sets stock buybacks.</title>
<headline>Checkpoint Systems sets stock buybacks.</headline>
<dateline>THOROFARE, N.J. 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Checkpoint Systems Inc saod Tuesday directors authorized the repurchase of up to 10 percent of its outstanding common stock.</p>
<p>The stock will be repurchased in the open market or in other transactions, the company said.</p>
<p>The timing of repurchases and number of shares actually repurchased will depend on a variety of factors, including price and other market considerations, it noted.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.))</p>
